    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-23T17:19:58+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-23T17:19:58+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-23T06:49:58Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-23T06:49:58Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough of low pressure that lies near the NT/WA border will combine with a trough and cold front further south to move over much of SA from Saturday, and over the far northeast on Sunday. A ridge of high pressure will then move into the west from late Sunday and persist over the rest of the state throughout next week.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW015" description="Mount Lofty Ranges" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-23T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-23T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers near the Barossa Valley, slight chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm near the Barossa Valley early this evening. Winds south to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending south to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h during the afternoon and evening.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of rain, most likely in the late afternoon and evening. The chance of a thunderstorm, possibly severe with damaging winds and large hail near the Barossa Valley. Winds southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly in the middle of the day then tending south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 12 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-25T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-26T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-24T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-25T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of rain, most likely in the morning and afternoon. Winds southerly 20 to 30 km/h turning west to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 11 with daytime temperatures reaching between 13 and 16.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-26T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-27T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-25T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-26T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. Winds west to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 9 with daytime temperatures reaching between 15 and 18.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-27T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-28T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-26T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-27T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers in the morning and afternoon. Winds west to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h tending south to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 6 and 9 with daytime temperatures reaching around 17.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
